<p>Entering its 50th year fielding girls' soccer teams, AYSO Region 13 held a Celebration of Women's Soccer on March 18, 2022 at the Rose Bowl.</p>

<p>The evening commemorated Region 13's role in creating the Brandi Chastain statue by the Rose Bowl, and served as a kickoff for Region 13's <a href="/about/sisterhood/">Sisterhood of Soccer</a> — a group of volunteers dedicated to recruiting and mentoring female players, referees, and coaches.</p>

<p>First, Region 13's younger players took over the field with small-sided games. Then Cobi Jones — former US Men's National Team and LA Galaxy star, and current co-owner of LA women's pro soccer team Angel City FC — gave the kids some inspiration. Finally, fans were treated to an exhibition match featuring Region 13's G16U and G19U players. Scroll down for a recap.</p>

